    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >--Story--</h2>This is the story of two girls, Saki and Kaede, who have been transferred to another world, Extasia. The girls fight to the death against &quot;magic weapons&quot; in order to return home from a world where magic is rife. An adventure that begins with an encounter with a mysterious talking wolf. What is the fate of Saki and Kaede...? And the mystery of the disasters that occur in the world is approached.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;I'm just interested in all the possibilities of your future.&quot; </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >--System--</h2>The game is an exploration 2D action RPG in which you control two protagonists who work together to fight the powerful enemies that await you.<br>\u30fbVariety of magic that can be customised freely.<br>\u30fbThe skill tree allows you to enhance your fighting style.<br>\u30fbNimble controls.<br>\u30fbAnalysis of the behaviour patterns of enemies and countermeasures.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >--Story--</h2>This is the story of two girls, Saki and Kaede, who have been transferred to another world, Extasia. The girls fight to the death against &quot;magic weapons&quot; in order to return home from a world where magic is rife. An adventure that begins with an encounter with a mysterious talking wolf. What is the fate of Saki and Kaede...? And the mystery of the disasters that occur in the world is approached.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;I'm just interested in all the possibilities of your future.&quot; </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >--System--</h2>The game is an exploration 2D action RPG in which you control two protagonists who work together to fight the powerful enemies that await you.<br>\u30fbVariety of magic that can be customised freely.<br>\u30fbThe skill tree allows you to enhance your fighting style.<br>\u30fbNimble controls.<br>\u30fbAnalysis of the behaviour patterns of enemies and countermeasures.",
    "short_description": "This is the story of two girls, Saki and Kaede, who have been transferred to the magic world of &quot;Ecstasia&quot;. In order to return home, the girls engage in mortal combat against &quot;magic weapons&quot;. Make use of a wide variety of magic and the cooperation between the two girls to defeat powerful enemies.",
